Quick reminder of the plan we made: the # + space part only. Your current flow is:

'%' → format[i + 1] → menu

With the bonus it becomes:

'%' → read flags (#, +, space) until a conversion letter → menu(letter, flags)

So the first job is just parsing. After you find a %, loop over the next characters while they’re #, + or a space, and record which ones you saw.

